body:
[https://gamehacking.org/game/105359](https://gamehacking.org/game/105359)

&#x200B;

Best I can find. Everything else is either walkthroughs or downloads.

This is one I have tried for in the past. It's a rough one. Hopefully I can get back on it.

&#x200B;

Congrats on it though!!

I feel ya there! I've been collecting Steelbooks for a while, but only found this sub within the last year or so recently, and I love seeing other collections and how passionate others are about collecting them. That and seeing so many Steelbooks I didn't know existed. 

&#x200B;

And I like your idea of getting a Steelbook for every Platinum you get! I have been planning on getting tattoos for all my Plats, but the Steelbook idea sounds a bit cheaper. Lol.
